@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

actor "业主" as Owner
actor "物业管理员" as Admin
participant "ReserveUI" as RUI
participant "ViolationUI" as VUI
participant "ReserveManager" as Ctrl
participant "ReserveLib" as RLib
participant "SystemManager" as SM
participant "ViolationLib" as VLib
participant "PetLib" as PLib

== 业主取消预约 ==
Owner -> RUI : 选择预约记录点击取消
RUI -> Ctrl : cancel(reservationId)
Ctrl -> RLib : getById(reservationId)
RLib --> Ctrl : 未开始
Ctrl -> RLib : updateStatus(CANCELLED) + 释放名额
Ctrl --> RUI : 取消成功
RUI --> Owner : 显示预约已取消

== 管理员确认违规 ==
Admin -> VUI : 新增违规记录
VUI -> SM : addViolation(ownerId, petId, type)
SM -> VLib : createRecord(ownerId, petId, type)
VLib --> SM : 记录成功
SM -> VLib : count365Days(ownerId, petId)
VLib --> SM : 违规次数
alt 次数>=3
    SM -> PLib : freezeCertificate(petId)
    PLib --> SM : 已冻结
end
SM --> VUI : 处理完成
VUI --> Admin : 显示违规处理结果
@enduml